===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|fo}} {{term|fótr|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|fo}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*fōts}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|fo}} {{term/t|ine-pro|*pṓds}}.

===Noun===
{{fo-noun|m|fótar|føtur}}

# [[foot]]
# [[leg]]
# 0,5 [[alin]] = 31,385 cm
